{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a strange portal to the <strong>Warp Dimension</strong> appears near your space station, mission control tasks you with exploring the strange anomalies on the other side... at any cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you venture deeper into this uncharted dimension, you'll unlock new technologies which will allow you to <i>upgrade your ship</i> and gain <i>abilities</i> that will help you explore further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A word of caution, however... Learning more about the Warp may also reveal some initially unseen dangers... or inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch and pilot spaceships into the portal, make new discoveries and reach greater depths. For better or for worse, <i>you will learn the secrets of the Warp</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882110/extras/ed3b415362d44b0605561c2f9aaf5fd4.poster.avif?t=1767038387\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882110/extras/ed3b415362d44b0605561c2f9aaf5fd4.webm?t=1767038387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882110/extras/ed3b415362d44b0605561c2f9aaf5fd4.mp4?t=1767038387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Incremental Progression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The beauty of Warp Marked lies in your failures. After every mission ends, you'll earn research points to improve your chances on the next.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever-Expanding Tech Tree</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your research points to unlock powerful upgrades and new abilities making each successive venture into the Warp better than the last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Great Unknown</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you learn more about the Warp Dimension, uncover secrets beyond scientific comprehension. For better or for worse, you will bring to light all that the Warp holds within.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882110/extras/7f6d72e06d5b1a3fc1118839dc440efa.poster.avif?t=1767038387\" aria-label=\"A large research tree than reveals new paths when previous ones are purchased.\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882110/extras/7f6d72e06d5b1a3fc1118839dc440efa.webm?t=1767038387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882110/extras/7f6d72e06d5b1a3fc1118839dc440efa.mp4?t=1767038387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3882110?t=1767038387","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3882110?t=1767038387","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882110/42dfd201c107c3157173c294f5e4e001557842d3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767038387","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882110/42dfd201c107c3157173c294f5e4e001557842d3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767038387","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id"